WEBVTT

00:02:09.048 --> 00:02:11.884
So that's the reason they
got us in here.

00:02:11.884 --> 00:02:14.487
Captain Gowa, you've got
to snap out of it!

00:02:14.487 --> 00:02:15.977
She's here.

00:02:22.995 --> 00:02:24.462
Captain Gowa!

00:02:26.432 --> 00:02:28.401
Loading 25mm AP rounds.

00:02:28.401 --> 00:02:30.369
No time. We're going to assume
their movement capacity

00:02:30.369 --> 00:02:33.167
to be equal to ours, and
calculate accordingly.

00:02:37.210 --> 00:02:40.475
We haven't even done a mock
TA to TA engagement yet!

00:02:48.487 --> 00:02:51.183
The reaction index of
Focus Two has decreased.

00:02:52.658 --> 00:02:54.093
Focus One, booting up.

00:02:54.093 --> 00:02:55.720
Change their formation
back, quickly!

00:03:02.268 --> 00:03:03.758
Target.

00:03:13.045 --> 00:03:15.047
I'm sorry I'm late.

00:03:15.047 --> 00:03:17.283
Please move out of the way.

00:03:17.283 --> 00:03:19.308
Captain Gowa is back
in formation.

00:03:40.439 --> 00:03:44.176
Captain Gowa's drive power
system is 180% over standard!

00:03:44.176 --> 00:03:45.177
What?

00:03:45.177 --> 00:03:46.712
The stage of stone...

00:03:46.712 --> 00:03:48.648
A correlation effect with the
surrounding space.

00:03:48.648 --> 00:03:50.138
It's the same?

00:03:53.085 --> 00:03:54.985
I never expected something
this well done.

00:03:57.390 --> 00:03:58.991
What's going on?!

00:03:58.991 --> 00:03:59.859
What's wrong?

00:03:59.859 --> 00:04:00.493
I'm losing torque in my legs!
What's wrong?

00:04:00.493 --> 00:04:01.619
I'm losing torque in my legs!

00:04:08.467 --> 00:04:11.237
A desert engagement is the worst
possible debut it could make.

00:04:11.237 --> 00:04:13.933
It was equipped assuming that it
would fight in urban situations.

00:04:14.573 --> 00:04:16.909
Captain Gowa, get away
from that one!

00:04:16.909 --> 00:04:18.774
That one moves differently
from all the others!

00:04:33.893 --> 00:04:36.095
The secondary articulation
systems are losing power!

00:04:36.095 --> 00:04:38.586
It's the sand. The sand is
getting into the joints.

00:04:46.505 --> 00:04:48.939
It looks like they're having a
difficult time with this as well.

00:04:49.442 --> 00:04:51.376
A divine wind...

00:04:55.147 --> 00:04:58.378
Who are you?

00:05:22.742 --> 00:05:28.381
This is footage taken by SNN
correspondent, Ronald Feigen.

00:05:28.381 --> 00:05:33.910
It appears that bipedal weapons
were involved in this battle.

00:05:37.390 --> 00:05:40.092
Currently, half of Belgistan is
engulfed in a powerful sandstorm,

00:05:40.092 --> 00:05:42.862
and a virtual ceasefire is in effect
as a consequence of this storm.

00:05:42.862 --> 00:05:45.854
We should be able to have
Ronald Feigen with us soon.

00:05:48.667 --> 00:05:52.467
Damn, so they were working
on TA's after all.

00:05:53.773 --> 00:05:58.511
This TA with the lilies was far more
skillful than the others.

00:05:58.511 --> 00:06:00.945
Yushiro, did you notice anything
about that one?

00:06:01.747 --> 00:06:04.181
I had other things on my mind.

00:06:06.485 --> 00:06:08.885
All this, it isn't easy on you, is it?

00:06:09.989 --> 00:06:12.591
Since we're alone here,
I'm going to say this.

00:06:12.591 --> 00:06:16.960
I like you, and I'm worried about
you as your brother.

00:06:17.496 --> 00:06:18.986
I as well.

00:06:23.969 --> 00:06:27.039
We peeled it off because
vacuuming alone wasn't enough.

00:06:27.039 --> 00:06:29.175
We need to replace several
modules also.

00:06:29.175 --> 00:06:30.910
Can you do it before sundown?

00:06:30.910 --> 00:06:34.539
We'll do what we can. We'll see
what we can do for the sand too.

00:06:56.769 --> 00:06:59.863
It looks like the sand, more than
the enemy, is the issue at hand.

00:07:00.673 --> 00:07:02.402
That's not the only issue we have.

00:07:03.442 --> 00:07:05.144
Answer me!

00:07:05.144 --> 00:07:07.203
What was all that about?

00:07:11.484 --> 00:07:13.577
It is your duty to answer
this question, Captain!

00:07:19.992 --> 00:07:22.119
I thought you blew a fuse.

00:07:22.761 --> 00:07:26.198
I've heard about guys that go nuts
once they get a whiff of war.

00:07:26.198 --> 00:07:28.968
Is that it? Was that the reason
you acted like that?

00:07:28.968 --> 00:07:30.436
To me, it was as if you were...

00:07:30.436 --> 00:07:32.768
He was doing what,
Captain Tokudaiji?

00:07:36.442 --> 00:07:37.643
Nothing.

00:07:37.643 --> 00:07:39.812
This all stems from the question...

00:07:39.812 --> 00:07:44.215
the question of having
a civilian among us.

00:07:45.017 --> 00:07:47.019
I will make that decision.

00:07:47.019 --> 00:07:50.723
Captain Gowa, is there anything
you want to say in your defense?

00:07:50.723 --> 00:07:52.057
No, Sir.

00:07:52.057 --> 00:07:53.547
Right, you may go.

00:07:55.161 --> 00:07:58.564
Data provided to us indicates
these bipedal weapons are

00:07:58.564 --> 00:08:02.295
Japanese equipment, but this
has not been verified.

00:08:03.402 --> 00:08:08.533
We don't know what types of lethal
capacities this weapon has either.

00:08:09.141 --> 00:08:12.745
We will enter the battle zone
tomorrow morning

00:08:12.745 --> 00:08:15.270
in an attempt to obtain clearer
footage of this weapon.

00:08:15.981 --> 00:08:19.919
Representatives from Belgistan
and the peacekeeping forces

00:08:19.919 --> 00:08:22.288
have just concluded unofficial
talks being held in Ramatieffstan.

00:08:22.288 --> 00:08:26.659
The foreign minister of
Ramatieffstan, a nation
neighboring Belgistan,

00:08:26.659 --> 00:08:29.628
attempted to broker a
ceasefire agreement, but

00:08:29.628 --> 00:08:34.366
regrettably, Belgistan is not willing
to accept the proposed plans,

00:08:34.366 --> 00:08:36.493
and the talks have
been broken off.

00:08:38.037 --> 00:08:38.938
No matter how you look at it,

00:08:38.938 --> 00:08:43.375
it doesn't make sense for
Belgistan to continue their
hard line approach.

00:08:43.375 --> 00:08:44.944
Its war efforts can't be sustained

00:08:44.944 --> 00:08:48.277
without a third party providing
economic or military assistance.

00:09:03.629 --> 00:09:08.234
I want you to give me a detailed
report on today's fighting.

00:09:08.234 --> 00:09:10.035
Particularly, in regards to Miharu.

00:09:10.035 --> 00:09:11.403
Yes, Sir!

00:09:11.403 --> 00:09:14.240
We believe there will be
positive consequences

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:17.698
resulting from Miharu's exposure
to the influence of the ruins.

00:09:22.848 --> 00:09:25.112
I will send you the strategic
sheets later.

00:09:25.718 --> 00:09:29.176
What of Miharu's recovery
up to this point?

00:09:29.688 --> 00:09:32.524
Physically she has almost
completely recovered,

00:09:32.524 --> 00:09:35.652
but psychologically she is still
unstable in certain aspects.

00:09:59.418 --> 00:10:00.885
I...

00:10:01.887 --> 00:10:04.253
I just want to know who I am.

00:10:05.157 --> 00:10:06.488
Why do you...

00:10:22.808 --> 00:10:24.877
Many nations have been
competing covertly

00:10:24.877 --> 00:10:27.546
in the development of bipedal
movement systems for some time.

00:10:27.546 --> 00:10:30.449
This is a weapon based on a
completely new concept.

00:10:30.449 --> 00:10:34.586
Compared to contemporary land
based weapons, such as tanks,

00:10:34.586 --> 00:10:37.856
offensive and defensive
operations in urban environments

00:10:37.856 --> 00:10:39.725
are where weapon systems like
these would be the most effective.

00:10:39.725 --> 00:10:41.160
I'm sorry, but I need to interrupt.

00:10:41.160 --> 00:10:43.696
It appears we have a live feed
from Ronald Feigen.

00:10:43.696 --> 00:10:45.731
Feigen? Feigen?

00:10:45.731 --> 00:10:48.734
As dawn arrives, Belgistan is
surrounded by an eerie silence.

00:10:48.734 --> 00:10:52.438
However, this is but the
calm before the storm.

00:10:52.438 --> 00:10:56.041
The virtual ceasefire must be
considered all but expired.

00:10:56.041 --> 00:10:56.508
It looks like this correspondent
is willing to risk his life

00:10:56.508 --> 00:10:58.577
It looks like this correspondent
is willing to risk his life
We'll embark to areas where we
hope to see bipedal weapons...

00:10:58.577 --> 00:11:01.603
to propagandize for TA's.
We'll embark to areas where we
hope to see bipedal weapons...

00:11:03.415 --> 00:11:06.043
Are the Gowa family the
pioneers of a new era?

00:11:07.152 --> 00:11:08.619
Or...

00:11:27.106 --> 00:11:29.641
The deal was that I'll handle
it up to that point.

00:11:29.641 --> 00:11:31.810
I leave the rest to you.

00:11:31.810 --> 00:11:34.278
You owe me more like
an entire bar.

00:11:35.848 --> 00:11:38.784
I hope you're not wearing yourself
out, coming all the way out here.

00:11:38.784 --> 00:11:39.685
It's nothing.

00:11:39.685 --> 00:11:42.121
General Dole, I'm certain
you've heard,

00:11:42.121 --> 00:11:45.224
but the third party nation
supporting the Belgistan Republic

00:11:45.224 --> 00:11:46.692
is utilizing equipment nearly
identical to TA's.

00:11:46.692 --> 00:11:51.061
We don't know it's a nation
supporting them, do we?

00:12:00.272 --> 00:12:04.510
This is a wonderful opportunity to
show off the TA's, right, Kiyoharu?

00:12:04.510 --> 00:12:07.968
To advertise the technology
made possible by Gowa.

00:12:09.648 --> 00:12:12.751
Sir, we still don't know where
they've stationed their TA's.

00:12:12.751 --> 00:12:14.776
Did you think I came with nothing?

00:12:15.621 --> 00:12:18.290
I've forwarded intelligence
gathered by NORAD to you.

00:12:18.290 --> 00:12:21.126
There's no way to deceive the eye
of the digital god of today.

00:12:21.126 --> 00:12:22.561
Spy satellites?

00:12:22.561 --> 00:12:26.231
I will exercise my command
authority granted in the treaty.

00:12:26.231 --> 00:12:27.266
Yes, Sir!

00:12:27.266 --> 00:12:32.838
You are to seize at least one
enemy bipedal tactical weapon.

00:12:32.838 --> 00:12:34.573
Those are your orders.

00:12:34.573 --> 00:12:37.235
Not neutralization?

00:12:39.478 --> 00:12:44.040
I want at least one secured.
I'll leave the rest up to you.

00:12:45.017 --> 00:12:48.248
TC 3rd Experimental Company will
begin preparations immediately!

00:13:02.267 --> 00:13:05.498
Coordinates 130, 30, 921.

00:13:06.038 --> 00:13:08.472
They seem to be inside an
abandoned village.

00:13:09.141 --> 00:13:11.041
No attempt to camouflage
themselves?

00:13:11.677 --> 00:13:15.447
Even if it is a trap, we still
have to go, right?

00:13:15.447 --> 00:13:19.213
Ordinarily, you would hit them
with an aerial bombardment.

00:13:19.952 --> 00:13:22.420
There's a reason behind
our being dispatched.

00:13:35.434 --> 00:13:39.204
Japanese SSDF Special
Forces on a US base?

00:13:39.204 --> 00:13:43.004
That's makes sense. So it was
"Made in Japan" after all.

00:13:43.909 --> 00:13:48.046
Yeah, our guide's been able to
gather some information.

00:13:48.046 --> 00:13:51.607
He tells me giants were witnessed
resting at an abandoned village.

00:13:52.551 --> 00:13:55.418
You know, giants! Giants!

00:14:04.429 --> 00:14:05.418
This is it?

00:14:06.431 --> 00:14:07.599
What happened?!

00:14:07.599 --> 00:14:10.269
I can't tell. But our feed's
been interrupted.

00:14:10.269 --> 00:14:11.258
Was it shot down?

00:14:12.170 --> 00:14:14.006
All Focus units, prepare
to engage.

00:14:14.006 --> 00:14:15.564
We are now at Defcon 4.

00:14:26.785 --> 00:14:27.877
Captain Gowa!

00:14:28.921 --> 00:14:31.890
I'll leave that schoolgirl TA with
the flowers to you, okay?

00:14:35.027 --> 00:14:36.828
Dopamine receptor index...

00:14:36.828 --> 00:14:40.065
Platoon A, Focus One and
Focus Two, no irregularities.

00:14:40.065 --> 00:14:43.335
Platoon B, Focus Three and
Focus Four, no irregularities.

00:14:43.335 --> 00:14:44.825
System up.

00:15:17.836 --> 00:15:19.201
What is that?

00:15:19.738 --> 00:15:21.137
That's a decoy!

00:15:27.312 --> 00:15:30.349
Was it pre-ordained that there
would be fighting?

00:15:30.349 --> 00:15:32.647
There was no other option.
Not for us.

00:15:49.401 --> 00:15:51.665
Focus One, hit. Minor damage.

00:15:58.210 --> 00:15:59.677
Focus One, pull back!

00:16:01.780 --> 00:16:02.769
Yushiro!

00:16:07.252 --> 00:16:08.879
Damn, they've started already!

00:16:17.195 --> 00:16:18.958
We got ourselves a scoop!

00:16:20.666 --> 00:16:22.827
Damn! They're jamming us!

00:16:31.076 --> 00:16:33.101
Captain Gowa, come on!

00:16:37.015 --> 00:16:38.607
There she is! The Lily!

00:16:39.951 --> 00:16:42.087
Focus One, reboot your systems!

00:16:42.087 --> 00:16:43.577
Can you hear me?!

00:16:46.191 --> 00:16:47.283
Focus One?!

00:17:02.874 --> 00:17:04.341
Focus Three's been hit!

00:17:04.876 --> 00:17:08.980
Focus One's EEG shows activities
reaching close to 1 Ghz!

00:17:08.980 --> 00:17:10.470
We need to stop this!

00:17:32.971 --> 00:17:34.461
Focus One has rebooted
his system!

00:17:41.613 --> 00:17:44.116
Finally! A frequency range
uninhibited by the ECM.

00:17:44.116 --> 00:17:44.850
This is good!

00:17:44.850 --> 00:17:45.984
Good!

00:17:45.984 --> 00:17:47.953
Make sure you get everything!

00:17:47.953 --> 00:17:50.148
This is how wars will be
fought in the future.

00:17:56.495 --> 00:17:59.431
Miharu, abnormalities are showing
up in the GS reaction index.

00:17:59.431 --> 00:18:03.602
You need to recognize who
you are on a deeper level.

00:18:03.602 --> 00:18:06.304
Listen to me. You are an invitator.

00:18:06.304 --> 00:18:07.931
You need to...

00:18:13.879 --> 00:18:15.039
Go forward.

00:18:15.914 --> 00:18:17.211
Emergency.

00:18:30.996 --> 00:18:32.258
Big brother...

00:18:35.734 --> 00:18:39.371
Misuzu, you mustn't be distracted.

00:18:39.371 --> 00:18:40.861
Yes, Ma'am.

00:19:08.099 --> 00:19:09.935
We've just received word
from Belgistan.

00:19:09.935 --> 00:19:12.233
Apparently, we will get a live feed
from there. Please stand by!

00:19:24.382 --> 00:19:27.252
Focus Three and Four have a
handle on the other enemy units.

00:19:27.252 --> 00:19:29.788
We will make that TA our
target for capture.

00:19:29.788 --> 00:19:30.755
Capture?

00:19:30.755 --> 00:19:31.289
The pilot and all! Don't you
remember the briefing?!
Capture?

00:19:31.289 --> 00:19:33.484
The pilot and all! Don't you
remember the briefing?!

00:19:34.359 --> 00:19:37.629
War will be fought hand to hand
between giants again!

00:19:37.629 --> 00:19:39.597
All we need to do now is connect
to the studio, and...

00:19:45.470 --> 00:19:48.701
You have to be kidding! Those
are NATO attack aircraft.

00:19:49.808 --> 00:19:52.743
That's impossible! What are
they going to do now?

00:19:56.147 --> 00:19:57.449
I've just been informed

00:19:57.449 --> 00:20:01.319
that we'll be bringing you live
footage of the bipedal weapons.

00:20:01.319 --> 00:20:04.022
Please stand by and don't
change the channel.

00:20:04.022 --> 00:20:06.625
A live feed from a
Tornado fighter...

00:20:06.625 --> 00:20:08.820
This is going to be one heck
of a live broadcast.

00:20:12.163 --> 00:20:14.666
Damn, they're screwing this all up!

00:20:14.666 --> 00:20:16.568
Are you sure about
taping this still?

00:20:16.568 --> 00:20:18.403
Go ahead and keep the
camera rolling.

00:20:18.403 --> 00:20:21.201
The world needs to know about
what's taking place here.

00:20:24.876 --> 00:20:29.281
The war of the giants must be
made public to the world.

00:20:29.281 --> 00:20:31.272
You...

00:20:31.950 --> 00:20:36.148
But not by you.

00:20:41.893 --> 00:20:46.091
This is a live feed from a fighter
with the multinational forces.

00:20:46.765 --> 00:20:51.464
Will history remember this war for
a new form of fighting?

00:20:54.272 --> 00:20:57.070
Miharu, that's enough.
Return to base.

00:21:03.848 --> 00:21:04.749
Change display image.

00:21:04.749 --> 00:21:05.350
Don't go after them!
Change display image.

00:21:05.350 --> 00:21:05.817
Don't go after them!

00:21:05.817 --> 00:21:08.115
If you go in there with your current
gear, you'll break down again.

00:21:17.629 --> 00:21:20.098
Should we tail the armed
chopper? Over.

00:21:20.098 --> 00:21:23.068
There's no need for that. The feed
was broadcast without a hitch.

00:21:23.068 --> 00:21:25.969
Proceed to bombing point.

00:21:35.246 --> 00:21:38.817
The multinational forces which
took the footage we witnessed,

00:21:38.817 --> 00:21:44.022
has started a bombardment of
military HQ in Kaha.

00:21:44.022 --> 00:21:46.286
We're going there live now.

00:21:53.398 --> 00:21:54.933
What is the meaning of this?!

00:21:54.933 --> 00:21:57.268
Why did you pull back
the Fake forces?

00:21:57.268 --> 00:22:00.205
We appreciate the cooperation
your nation was willing to provide

00:22:00.205 --> 00:22:02.307
for the excavation of the ruins.

00:22:02.307 --> 00:22:06.411
But we have paid off that debt.

00:22:06.411 --> 00:22:07.901
What?!

00:22:08.546 --> 00:22:12.751
Symbol will no longer interfere in
Belgistan's domestic issues.

00:22:12.751 --> 00:22:14.886
No, you can't!

00:22:14.886 --> 00:22:16.717
You can't do that!

00:22:18.056 --> 00:22:20.191
The White House has just held a
last minute press conference.

00:22:20.191 --> 00:22:22.227
The multinational forces
have surrounded Kaha

00:22:22.227 --> 00:22:24.491
and have begun an all out
offensive against the capital!

00:22:29.050 --> 00:22:33.870
Hark

00:22:35.030 --> 00:22:40.320
It's time I journey

00:22:43.850 --> 00:22:50.990
Break apart my heart

00:22:51.160 --> 00:22:57.520
For crimson sadness

00:22:57.850 --> 00:23:05.030
Pours out from it

00:23:05.240 --> 00:23:08.950
I can only, oh

00:23:09.060 --> 00:23:12.140
Close my eyes, oh

00:23:12.230 --> 00:23:17.750
I pray, let this break apart

00:23:32.970 --> 00:23:36.850
I can only, oh

00:23:36.940 --> 00:23:40.000
Close my eyes, oh

00:23:40.070 --> 00:23:45.200
I pray, let this break apart

00:23:46.730 --> 00:23:53.180
I beg you, be by my side

00:24:01.593 --> 00:24:03.322
It came as it was destined.

00:24:04.329 --> 00:24:05.887
I met her as it was destined.

00:24:06.631 --> 00:24:10.226
Yes, someone conspired
for us to meet again.

00:24:11.703 --> 00:24:13.534
But why?

00:24:15.607 --> 00:24:17.242
Enchanted I come

00:24:17.242 --> 00:24:19.437
We meet again deep down
inside the dark labyrinth

00:24:20.211 --> 00:24:23.476
My heart dances about like
a dangling puppet doll.

00:24:25.049 --> 00:24:27.244
I know her.
